@startuml
title UI-01 shell foundation v0.1 — DRAFT proposal
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
package "masd-web — independently deployed Angular application" {
  [Application shell\nheader / sidebar / breadcrumbs] as shell
  [Selector / user menu / theme\nbackground operations drawer] as controls
  [Existing lazy routed pages\nFuture unavailable views (proposed)] as pages
  [Auth] as auth
  [ProjectContext] as context
  [OperationsTracker] as tracker
  [Existing API adapters] as adapters
  shell --> controls
  shell --> pages
  controls --> auth
  controls --> context
  controls --> tracker
  pages --> adapters
  context --> adapters
  tracker --> adapters
}
component "Same-origin API boundary\nProject Service — existing owner" as api
database "Project Service persistence\nprojects / sessions / studio operations" as db
cloud "Configured OIDC provider" as oidc
auth --> api : cookie session / CSRF / safe return
adapters --> api : existing versioned contracts
api --> db
api --> oidc : server-side sign-in
note bottom of tracker
Followed runs are per-tab;
project history is bounded server data.
Discovery durability is a separate gap.
end note
note bottom of pages
No studio redesign or execution implementation.
No new microservice or framework proposed.
end note
@enduml
